WEBVTT

00:13.950 --> 00:15.870
They're the Magical Monsters
extermination squad.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.330
I see...

00:26.040 --> 00:27.080
Thank you.

00:42.660 --> 00:43.870
You're back.

00:49.830 --> 00:51.290
Onee-chan...

00:52.340 --> 00:57.670
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:52.340 --> 00:57.670
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:57.670 --> 01:02.170
Seven colours are not enough

00:57.670 --> 01:02.170
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

01:02.170 --> 01:07.840
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

01:02.170 --> 01:05.170
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

01:05.170 --> 01:07.840
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

01:07.840 --> 01:13.840
The story is going beyond

01:07.840 --> 01:13.840
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:18.010 --> 01:23.340
The bell toll in my heart

01:18.010 --> 01:23.340
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:23.340 --> 01:27.670
is getting louder bit by bit

01:23.340 --> 01:27.670
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:27.670 --> 01:31.170
Believe in the excitement

01:27.670 --> 01:31.170
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:31.170 --> 01:33.670
And take one step forward

01:31.170 --> 01:33.670
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:33.670 --> 01:41.000
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:33.670 --> 01:41.000
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:39.340 --> 01:42.000
Can't be for sure

01:39.340 --> 01:42.000
zettai nante nai

01:41.000 --> 01:43.670
Nothing

01:41.000 --> 01:43.670
nanimo

01:42.000 --> 01:44.670
There's no guarantee

01:42.000 --> 01:44.670
kakushin wa dekinai

01:43.670 --> 01:46.340
No one

01:43.670 --> 01:46.340
daremo

01:44.670 --> 01:47.340
But I won't give up

01:44.670 --> 01:47.340
demo akiramenai

01:46.340 --> 01:49.000
That's why

01:46.340 --> 01:49.000
dakara

01:47.340 --> 01:49.500
I can still move forward

01:47.340 --> 01:49.500
susundeku koto ga

01:49.330 --> 01:50.840
I can still move forward

01:49.330 --> 01:50.840
dekiru yo

01:50.840 --> 01:56.670
Because there's magic right in here

01:50.840 --> 01:56.670
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:56.670 --> 02:03.000
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:56.670 --> 02:03.000
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

02:03.000 --> 02:07.670
I can't stop now

02:03.000 --> 02:07.670
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

02:07.670 --> 02:13.340
It entered into a new era

02:07.670 --> 02:13.340
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

02:13.340 --> 02:17.670
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

02:13.340 --> 02:17.670
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:17.670 --> 02:21.340
And go beyond the future

02:17.670 --> 02:21.340
saki no hou e

02:26.750 --> 02:29.160
Onee-chan, I...

02:29.160 --> 02:30.750
This is why I told you

02:30.750 --> 02:32.330
that you shouldn't go.

02:35.660 --> 02:39.080
You don't ever have to think
about being a witch.

02:44.330 --> 02:48.620
Ti... a... ra... sa... ma!

02:50.620 --> 02:52.080
Anna.

02:52.080 --> 02:54.080
Welcome home.

02:55.660 --> 02:58.790
Honestly, what were you thinking?!

02:58.790 --> 03:01.040
You went all the way
to Malmcester all alone?

03:01.040 --> 03:04.450
Do you realize who you are?!

03:04.450 --> 03:08.080
And you not contacting us
even once is unheard of!

03:08.080 --> 03:10.410
I'm sorry I left without permission. But—

03:10.410 --> 03:12.750
No ifs, ands, or buts!

03:12.750 --> 03:15.870
Do you realize how worried we all were?!

03:15.870 --> 03:18.000
And that's exactly why Eliza-sama—

03:20.250 --> 03:22.290
What about my sister?

03:22.290 --> 03:27.500
Nothing. I just wish you were
as tame as your sister.

03:27.500 --> 03:31.250
You're turning more and more
into Louise-sama every day.

03:31.250 --> 03:33.040
Where are Mother and the others?

03:33.040 --> 03:38.540
She's currently heading to Dortgart
in order to attend the Witches' Council.

03:38.540 --> 03:42.290
I see. She really does love
going to other countries.

03:42.290 --> 03:45.250
She's not going there to play, you know.

03:45.250 --> 03:46.620
I know, I know.

04:00.750 --> 04:02.790
Um, Onee-chan...

04:02.790 --> 04:05.580
Why can't I become a witch?

04:07.000 --> 04:08.910
That's enough.

04:08.910 --> 04:14.120
I'm finally better, so I want to do what I want.

04:14.120 --> 04:16.950
I want to see just how far I can go!

04:16.950 --> 04:19.580
And yet, you got expelled.

04:21.660 --> 04:24.910
But that's... I just—

04:24.910 --> 04:28.370
You need to be more aware of the fact
that you're the Second Princess of Waleland.

04:28.370 --> 04:32.700
You don't need to worry about
becoming anything more or less.

04:32.700 --> 04:35.660
Then why did you become a witch, Onee-chan?

04:39.750 --> 04:43.250
I am currently fulfilling
my duties as the princess.

04:45.910 --> 04:48.330
I want to be a witch...

04:48.330 --> 04:50.700
I want to be just like you, Onee-chan!

04:52.370 --> 04:54.540
You can't become a witch just from aspirations.

04:57.750 --> 04:59.370
We're done talking about this.

05:08.540 --> 05:13.000
Wow! They all bloomed beautifully.

05:13.000 --> 05:15.200
Tiara, I'll show you something super special.

05:23.370 --> 05:26.040
Wow!

05:26.040 --> 05:28.120
It almost looks like the sky!

05:28.120 --> 05:30.790
They'll go back to normal
after enough time passes.

05:30.790 --> 05:33.120
You're going to become a witch, right, Onee-chan?

05:33.120 --> 05:35.120
Yes. That's my dream.

05:35.120 --> 05:37.620
You're going to be the best witch ev—

05:39.330 --> 05:40.370
Tiara!

05:41.450 --> 05:45.000
Hang in there! Let's get you
back to bed, okay?

05:45.000 --> 05:46.250
Okay...

05:48.950 --> 05:52.830
Are you sure I can have this?

05:52.830 --> 05:56.040
Yes. It's your 13th birthday present.

05:57.080 --> 05:59.080
Thank you...

05:59.080 --> 06:01.330
It looks perfect on you.
Make sure you take good care—

06:02.910 --> 06:05.250
Are you okay?

06:05.250 --> 06:07.250
I just have a little cough, is all.

06:07.250 --> 06:09.700
Now, would you like me to sing for you?

06:11.450 --> 06:14.580
Yeah! I love your songs!

06:14.580 --> 06:18.000
Oh, and you only love my songs?

06:18.000 --> 06:20.410
I love you, too, silly!

06:23.080 --> 06:25.040
Look, Onee-chan!

06:25.040 --> 06:27.250
I'm all better now.

06:28.580 --> 06:30.790
I feel like I can do anything now!

06:38.410 --> 06:40.040
Onee-chan?

06:43.870 --> 06:48.410
Tiara-sama, please don't dwell on this too much.

06:48.410 --> 06:50.830
Would you like some fruit for dessert?

06:51.830 --> 06:52.910
Mm.

06:59.700 --> 07:03.000
Please don't be too angry with Eliza-sama.

07:17.790 --> 07:19.040
We're finally here.

07:20.620 --> 07:21.660
Ow...

07:21.660 --> 07:23.870
I can't believe it took almost three days...

07:23.870 --> 07:25.450
My butt's going to split...

07:25.450 --> 07:28.250
This way, everyone.

07:28.250 --> 07:30.790
How is she okay?

07:30.790 --> 07:33.120
Does she have a butt of steel?

07:33.120 --> 07:34.910
Hold up, Rose-chan!

07:36.080 --> 07:38.250
You may not pass without permission!

07:40.250 --> 07:43.790
I am the daughter of
the master of Alnwick, Rosetta.

07:43.790 --> 07:46.500
I would like to request
an audience with Princess Tiara.

07:48.290 --> 07:52.040
I will go get confirmation,
so I request that you wait until then.

07:52.040 --> 07:54.040
How long will that take?

07:54.040 --> 07:57.370
Well... Probably three days.

07:57.370 --> 07:59.040
Three days?

07:59.040 --> 08:00.500
That's a civil servant for you.

08:00.500 --> 08:01.620
Hey.

08:01.620 --> 08:04.450
All right. We will come back then.

08:08.620 --> 08:10.540
What do we do now?

08:10.540 --> 08:12.330
I mean...

08:12.330 --> 08:14.500
We'll just have to wait.

08:14.500 --> 08:19.290
Aw, and I thought we'd be having
a feast tonight at the palace.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.580
That's what you were thinking about?

08:21.580 --> 08:24.200
Sorry, I was, too.

08:24.200 --> 08:27.410
Well, why wouldn't we?

08:27.410 --> 08:28.410
Hot!

08:28.410 --> 08:31.250
—Hot, hot, hot, hot!
—What are you doing, you Silly Rabbit?

08:31.250 --> 08:34.160
For now, we can just stay at my place.

08:34.160 --> 08:35.500
Is it nearby?

08:35.500 --> 08:37.750
It's about half a day by carriage.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.450
Carriages again?

08:39.450 --> 08:42.370
Why don't we stay at an inn tonight?

08:42.370 --> 08:45.540
So hey, can't we just sneak in to see her?

08:46.620 --> 08:48.620
You know. Using those things.

09:02.160 --> 09:03.700
Nettie, you've gotten really good.

09:04.700 --> 09:08.290
I can't just always keep relying on all of you.

09:08.290 --> 09:09.290
Stop.

09:11.370 --> 09:12.580
It's a dead end...

09:14.250 --> 09:16.370
It's quite sturdy.

09:16.370 --> 09:18.040
Should we use magic?

09:18.040 --> 09:21.410
Reinforcement magic?
That'll take too much out of you.

09:21.410 --> 09:22.790
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

09:31.120 --> 09:31.990
Take that!

09:31.990 --> 09:35.500
Wow, you did both at once.

09:35.500 --> 09:37.700
I see. You used thermal expansion.

09:37.700 --> 09:39.580
Huh? Thermal wha...?

09:39.580 --> 09:41.830
You mean you didn't know this would happen?

09:41.830 --> 09:44.290
Nah, I was just fooling around,
mixing stuff together,

09:44.290 --> 09:47.370
and it was a lot of fun breaking stuff!

09:47.370 --> 09:48.310
Really?

09:48.310 --> 09:49.790
Let's get going.

09:57.290 --> 09:59.290
We somehow made it in safely.

09:59.290 --> 10:02.250
Let's proceed by hiding
behind things here on out.

10:03.830 --> 10:06.160
Hurry, please...

10:06.160 --> 10:07.950
Rose-chan, you're heavy...

10:13.120 --> 10:15.540
Security sure is heavy...

10:15.540 --> 10:17.160
Which way should we go?

10:17.160 --> 10:20.750
There's a shortcut over there
if we can just get over there.

10:20.750 --> 10:24.160
This calls for a decoy...
And by that, I mean Lavie.

10:24.160 --> 10:25.660
Mfhy mfe?!

10:25.660 --> 10:28.000
No, leave this to me.

10:30.040 --> 10:31.080
Who's there?!

10:36.500 --> 10:37.500
What's wrong?

10:37.500 --> 10:39.830
I thought I heard a noise...

10:39.830 --> 10:42.160
I'm sure it was just a frog or some bugs.

10:42.160 --> 10:43.790
You think so?

10:43.790 --> 10:47.410
I thought I felt a suspicious presence...

10:44.300 --> 10:47.410
I can't believe you can use
such advanced magic.

10:47.410 --> 10:49.290
It's far from perfect yet, but...

10:51.500 --> 10:52.910
Um...

10:52.910 --> 10:55.370
I'm stuck.

10:55.370 --> 10:57.330
Ready, and...

10:57.330 --> 10:58.660
Ow, ow, ow!

11:02.200 --> 11:05.000
It's dark. It's cramped. It's scary.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.250
Hang on a sec.

11:33.910 --> 11:35.200
And now...

11:36.410 --> 11:37.620
We go this way.

11:37.620 --> 11:39.290
I'm surprised you remember.

11:39.290 --> 11:42.250
Tia and I found this route
when we were little and exploring.

11:42.250 --> 11:45.410
I guess you two were pretty rambunctious.

11:45.410 --> 11:46.660
Lynette?!

11:46.660 --> 11:48.120
'Sup?

11:48.120 --> 11:51.120
I just... felt something on my foot.

11:53.580 --> 11:54.870
It's just a mouse.

11:57.540 --> 11:59.160
That startled me.

12:04.370 --> 12:05.620
Looks like we're clear.

12:06.830 --> 12:08.500
Where are we?

12:08.500 --> 12:09.620
The shrine.

12:11.080 --> 12:12.620
It's Flora-sama.

12:15.540 --> 12:18.540
From here on out,
we'll have to move through the palace.

12:18.540 --> 12:21.870
We'll probably be hard to spot if we use
that Transparency Magic again.

12:21.870 --> 12:25.160
I don't have enough strength to use it again.

12:25.160 --> 12:27.620
Guess we'll just have to sneak about then.

13:23.160 --> 13:25.040
They spotted us!

13:25.040 --> 13:27.660
Hey! Halt!

13:26.160 --> 13:28.500
Ashley, you dummy!

13:28.500 --> 13:30.080
After them!

13:33.910 --> 13:35.040
This way!

13:37.620 --> 13:39.000
Who goes there?!

13:43.000 --> 13:44.330
What's going on?

13:44.330 --> 13:46.500
It appears that there are
intruders in the palace.

13:46.500 --> 13:48.330
Deal with them immediately.

13:48.330 --> 13:49.410
Yes, ma'am!

13:51.000 --> 13:52.160
Crap!

14:05.540 --> 14:07.000
Ashley-san?!

14:11.750 --> 14:15.370
Honour the name of the witch of
this ritual and dance, servant!

14:23.080 --> 14:25.000
Wait, you're—

14:26.120 --> 14:28.330
That's enough!

14:28.330 --> 14:30.660
You can't run forever!

14:30.660 --> 14:32.660
Ugh, they just won't give up.

14:34.450 --> 14:35.450
Lavie!

15:01.500 --> 15:02.700
Anna?

15:02.700 --> 15:07.080
Yes? My stars! If it isn't Lady Rose!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.620
It's been so long.

15:08.620 --> 15:13.200
Honestly. If you're going to play
hide and seek, find somewhere else.

15:13.200 --> 15:16.750
I'm sorry this is sudden, but please, help us.

15:16.750 --> 15:18.200
I beg your pardon?

15:22.790 --> 15:25.620
Eliza-sama! You're Eliza-sama, aren't you?!

15:25.620 --> 15:27.160
I absolutely love Ray, and—

15:27.160 --> 15:29.040
What are you doing here?

15:30.660 --> 15:33.620
Did you actually come all this way to see Tiara?

15:33.620 --> 15:36.410
How do you know about us...

15:40.540 --> 15:42.910
You can cancel the alert.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.500
Are you certain?

15:44.500 --> 15:45.700
Yes.

15:53.200 --> 15:56.580
Tiara-sama, I'm coming in.

15:56.580 --> 15:57.830
—Tia-san!
—Tiara!

15:57.830 --> 16:00.000
Wait, what are you doing here?!

16:00.000 --> 16:02.290
We were all worried about you.

16:02.290 --> 16:05.080
We couldn't just end things
like that, could we?

16:05.080 --> 16:07.580
There's still so much we want to do together!

16:07.580 --> 16:11.040
And you still haven't
bought me my Hamburg steak.

16:11.040 --> 16:15.910
Everyone... But we were expelled...

16:15.910 --> 16:17.660
So what?

16:17.660 --> 16:18.790
Huh?!

16:18.790 --> 16:22.450
Tia, what do you want to do?

16:22.450 --> 16:28.040
I... I still want to be a witch,
just like my sister.

16:28.040 --> 16:28.790
In that case—

16:28.790 --> 16:30.620
But my sister told me...

16:30.620 --> 16:33.330
...that I can't become a witch
just by aspirations.

16:35.330 --> 16:37.080
I mean, she's sorta right.

16:38.910 --> 16:42.200
Well, you're just you.

16:44.500 --> 16:48.040
Yeah. Lavie's right.

16:48.040 --> 16:52.540
No matter how hard you try,
you won't be able to become Eliza-sama.

16:52.540 --> 16:55.700
They're right. You're you, Tiara.

16:55.700 --> 16:58.040
I'm... me?

16:59.790 --> 17:02.950
Everyone has their own way to their dreams.

17:02.950 --> 17:06.120
That's fine if it's just an aspiration.

17:06.120 --> 17:09.870
But if you keep chasing someone forever,

17:09.870 --> 17:13.080
won't you lose your own way?

17:15.160 --> 17:18.540
My own way?

17:18.540 --> 17:20.500
I...

17:20.500 --> 17:26.910
I want to be a witch that can cheer people up
just like my sister did for me.

17:26.910 --> 17:30.160
That feeling hasn't gone away.

17:30.160 --> 17:34.910
But after we did that Orchestra, I thought...

17:34.910 --> 17:38.620
At that moment, my heart
was dancing with happiness

17:38.620 --> 17:41.750
and I let my emotions get the better of me.

17:41.750 --> 17:46.370
I was concentrating more on myself
than the people watching us.

17:46.370 --> 17:51.620
And yet, I have the nerve to say that
I want to become a witch to help others...

17:53.750 --> 17:55.250
I think that's fine, though.

17:56.620 --> 18:00.200
Don't you think if you're
having fun and spreading cheer,

18:00.200 --> 18:02.540
it'll also make others happy?

18:02.540 --> 18:05.120
Yeah! You need to think about yourself first!

18:05.120 --> 18:08.200
You should actually think
about those around you more.

18:08.200 --> 18:11.500
You were absolutely dazzling
that night, Tiara-san.

18:11.500 --> 18:15.080
That's why I know you'll be able
to become someone's light!

18:15.080 --> 18:18.790
That's just how you do it, Tia-chan!

18:18.790 --> 18:21.000
How I do it...

18:21.000 --> 18:24.370
You just need to strive
to be who you want to be.

18:24.370 --> 18:27.120
That goes for you and the rest of us.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.540
Tia.

18:30.540 --> 18:32.040
Yeah.

18:32.040 --> 18:36.410
Thank you, everyone.
I'm going to keep doing my best.

18:39.000 --> 18:42.250
I'm going to be a witch
that only I can ever be!

18:42.250 --> 18:43.580
Heck yeah!

18:43.580 --> 18:44.910
That's our Tiara.

18:44.910 --> 18:47.290
Believe in yourself!

18:47.290 --> 18:49.370
No...

18:49.370 --> 18:54.450
I'm going to believe in us...
I'm going to believe in LiGHTs!

18:58.080 --> 19:02.250
Now that that's settled,
we need to figure out the next step.

19:02.250 --> 19:04.330
Anna! Get us some tea, please!

19:04.330 --> 19:05.870
Of course.

19:07.250 --> 19:09.750
Melissa and the others said that?

19:09.750 --> 19:13.200
Yes. They made us
realize something important.

19:13.200 --> 19:17.580
Being with you is way more important
than us being expelled!

19:17.580 --> 19:21.450
You're making me blush...

19:21.450 --> 19:23.160
Aw, no need to be shy!

19:24.450 --> 19:27.000
This is... amazing!

19:27.000 --> 19:28.330
It's pudding.

19:31.580 --> 19:34.200
It's so sweet and melts in your mouth!

19:34.200 --> 19:36.700
It makes you feel so happy.

19:36.700 --> 19:41.080
It's very different from the pudding I know...

19:41.080 --> 19:43.750
So about what we're going to do now...

19:43.750 --> 19:47.660
I don't think getting back into
the academy will be that simple.

19:47.660 --> 19:50.870
Y-Yeah, I figured...

19:50.870 --> 19:53.620
But with the five of us together,
we'll be able to figure it out!

19:53.620 --> 19:55.040
We are LiGHTs, after all!

19:57.040 --> 20:00.160
Wait, did I say something weird?

20:00.160 --> 20:01.830
No, that's not it.

20:01.830 --> 20:03.750
You've changed, Lyn-chan.

20:05.790 --> 20:07.160
So...

20:07.160 --> 20:08.370
At this rate,

20:08.370 --> 20:11.200
maybe we don't need to concentrate
on Flora Girl's Academy so much.

20:12.370 --> 20:15.120
There are other witches'
academies in other countries.

20:15.120 --> 20:16.700
Really?

20:16.700 --> 20:18.910
Let's try to become witches that way.

20:18.910 --> 20:22.700
But... I want to do Orchestras, too.

20:22.700 --> 20:25.160
I do, too.

20:25.160 --> 20:27.120
We all feel the same.

20:27.120 --> 20:29.410
Let's improve our singing and dancing.

20:29.410 --> 20:33.120
Then we'll go back to Malmcester
and show them our stuff!

20:33.120 --> 20:37.750
We'll make the academy
regret expelling us. Right?

20:38.790 --> 20:40.120
Yeah...

20:40.120 --> 20:44.870
Maybe we can just go to
all the neighboring countries.

20:44.870 --> 20:47.410
We're going seaside!

20:47.410 --> 20:49.330
You mean we're going worldwide.

20:49.330 --> 20:50.790
How's that any different?

20:52.620 --> 20:54.250
It just is, okay?

20:54.250 --> 20:55.910
What's that supposed to mean?

20:55.910 --> 20:57.580
It just is.

20:56.490 --> 20:58.830
There's no need to rush.

20:57.580 --> 20:59.570
I don't get it.

20:58.830 --> 20:59.750
Yes.

20:59.750 --> 21:01.410
Let's take our time to think about it.

21:01.410 --> 21:03.870
I want to check out the library.

21:03.870 --> 21:06.250
I'll have to make us more outfits.

21:06.250 --> 21:09.290
I wanna eat more of
that yummy stuff we just had.

21:09.290 --> 21:11.700
You already finished yours?

21:11.700 --> 21:13.410
Have as much as you'd like.

